PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 August to September came in at 35% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 January to February came in at 40%. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, with grid 22362 at 58%.</p>"}
